      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IT'S A GLAM (1) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at Taree Super Track over 525m behind Under Anesthetic (30.92) in a Grade 4/5. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Should bounce back. KALANI SKY (4) below best last time at this track (30.21) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 9 length fourth. Can feature in the finish. MIGHTY HENRY (3) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 29.90 beating JOCK FROM IBROX. The form from his last run stacks up well. Can measure up again. JOCK FROM IBROX (6) will need to repeat last run to feature.",
